{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Sampler"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A tracker built with samplers runs them on its worker, after its enrichers, so a sampler sees"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what they set:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let tracker = Tracker(samplers: [","    .events(of: Scrolled.self, rate: 0.1),","    .events(where: { $0.consentCategory == .performance }, rate: 0.5),","])"],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each sampler decides on its own, and a record is kept only if every sampler that applies to it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keeps it. A kept record carries the product of their rates as its "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/SampleRateKey"},{"type":"text","text":"; one no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sampler applies to is always kept and carries no key. Each dropped record is reported on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/samplingDropReports"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The decisions come from the tracker’s sampling seed, the same on every platform and Swift","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"release: with a seed fixed, which events are kept is fixed too. Each sampler draws from a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stream of its own, picked by its place in the tracker’s list: appending a sampler changes no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"other’s decisions, but inserting, removing or reordering one gives every sampler after it a new","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stream, so it decides differently under the same seed.","type":"text"}]}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Trackers\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo"}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler\/events(of:rate:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler\/events(where:rate:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler\/grouped(by:where:rate:)"],"title":"Type Methods","anchor":"Type-Methods","generated":true}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/sampler"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers"]]},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:8Trackers7SamplerV","roleHeading":"Structure","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Sampler","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"struct","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Sampler"}],"modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"title":"Sampler","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Sampler.swift#L28","fileName":"Sampler.swift"}},"abstract":[{"text":"Keeps a fraction of the events it applies to, and drops the rest before they are held, written","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or delivered: event by event, or a whole group of events, such as a session, at once.","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Sampler/events(of:rate:)":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/sampler\/events(of:rate:)","title":"eve